:''This article is about the Cat Unit. For the enemy, see [[Tasmanian Giant Crab (Enemy)]].''
'''Tasmanian Giant Crab''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that can be obtained from the [[Summer Break Cats Castaway (Event Gacha)|Summer Break Cats Castaway]] [[Cat Capsule#Collaboration Event Capsule|Event Cat Capsule]] using Legend Traps. It was added in [[Version 14.5 Update|Version 14.5]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 813
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Tasmanian Giant Crab
|name2 = Tasmanian Giant Crab CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Tasmanian Giant Crab CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Tasmanian Giant Crab is a mediocre [[Barrier Breaker]] that struggles to even do its job. Its abysmally slow speed and low HP oftentimes prevent it from even reaching its target, not to mention its range.

Even if it connects to a target's [[Barrier]], there's no guarantee that its ability even activates, making it unreliable at even the best of times. While it is cheap, Tasmanian Gaint Crab's cooldown is fairly long for how little it accomplishes during its lifespan. It is at least decent at breaking [[UltraBaaBaa]]'s Barrier on occasion, be it during restriction stages or the [[Underground Labyrinth]]. Its damage is also enough to cripple enemies for what it's worth, but landing said damage is very unlikely due to its previously mentioned speed, health and range.

It should only be used on special restriction stage if you don't have a special [[Barrier Breaker]].

{{Job|Classification = Breaker}}

